UEBulkExport is a command line front end. All container parsing and asset
conversion - mounting .utoc/.ucas/.pak, reading IoStore packages, resolving
unversioned properties against a .usmap, decoding textures, and writing
glTF, ActorX, USD and UEFormat output - is performed by CUE4Parse and
CUE4Parse-Conversion.

A full list of bundled and downloaded third-party components, with their
licenses, is in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
